<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Attendance Access — TLMPS</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f0fa; color: #1e293b; display: grid; place-items: center; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; padding: 16px; }
        .card { background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 8px 28px #3b1c5626; max-width: 400px; padding: 30px; text-align: center; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; }
        h1 { color: #3b1c56; font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 10px; }
        p { color: #475569; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 18px; }
        .error { background: #fef2f2; border-radius: 6px; color: #b91c1c; margin-bottom: 14px; padding: 10px; }
        input { border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6px; box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 11px; width: 100%; }
        button { background: #5c2d91; border: 0; border-radius: 6px; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; padding: 12px; width: 100%; }
        .back { color: #5c2d91; display: inline-block; margin-top: 16px; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="card">
        <h1>Attendance Register</h1>
        <p>Enter the superadmin password to open attendance directly. Opening it from the dashboard does not require another password.</p>
        <% if (error) { %><div class="error"><%= error %></div><% } %>
        <form method="POST" action="/superadmin/login">
            <input type="hidden" name="returnTo" value="<%= returnTo %>">
            <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="Superadmin password" autocomplete="current-password" required autofocus>
            <button type="submit">Verify and continue</button>
        </form>
        <a class="back" href="/superadmin/dashboard">← Back to dashboard</a>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
